{"data":[{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-23T14:41:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2069430589439308102"],"id":"2069430589439308102","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":1732,"like_count":16,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":1},"text":"因为那种情境激活了你身体里储存的旧记忆 ，你当时的无助感被重新唤醒了，不是你处理不好现在的问题，而是身体以为你又回到了那个无力还击的时刻。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2069430589439308102"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-23T12:29:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2069397467817455964"],"id":"2069397467817455964","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":3428,"like_count":35,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":0},"text":"世界上就是因为缺少太多好玩的人，所以导致这个世界一点都不好玩","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2069397467817455964"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-23T12:10:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2069392696398188609"],"id":"2069392696398188609","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1600,"like_count":11,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":1},"text":"我看起来很不聪明吗？！","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2069392696398188609"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-23T08:30:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2069337409968595248"],"id":"2069337409968595248","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3468,"like_count":74,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":3},"text":"我抗压能力太差了。。。。。每次以为自己没问题但是身体比我先有反应","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2069337409968595248"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-23T06:11:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2069302341292147063"],"id":"2069302341292147063","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2496,"like_count":43,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":7},"text":"回避思考会迟钝，认真思考自己的一生又会解离。\n连痛苦都感觉不真实，隔一会儿去看自己写的东西都理解不了在想什么。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2069302341292147063"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-23T06:10:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2069301929185050838"],"id":"2069301929185050838","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":2604,"like_count":52,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":7},"text":"我们再也不会说话了 但我还是会在你说过喜欢的一切东西里看到你","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2069301929185050838"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-23T06:09:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2069301863221243973"],"id":"2069301863221243973","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":7448,"like_count":157,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":30,"retweet_count":23},"text":"为什么曾经让我幸福的人现在却总让我悲伤","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2069301863221243973"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-23T05:59:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2069299315659657717"],"id":"2069299315659657717","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1853,"like_count":17,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":2},"text":": 第一志愿牛国英津大学，第二志愿上海跳旦大学，第三志愿下海交配大学","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2069299315659657717"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-23T05:42:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2069295107413876967"],"id":"2069295107413876967","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":14,"impression_count":11186,"like_count":253,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":44,"retweet_count":23},"text":"那些让你内耗和犹豫的时刻，其实都是命运在问你要不要换一种活法。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2069295107413876967"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-23T04:17:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2069273731869159911"],"id":"2069273731869159911","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1185,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"text":"去了解了一下旅行签和工作签需要的相关手续和证明…对未来充满期待…是只要踏踏实实过好当下每一天未来都可以做到的事情…","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2069273731869159911"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-22T14:38:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2069067588462891370"],"id":"20690675884628