8,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":34,"retweet_count":26},"text":"如果确定我无法获得幸福，我可以选择结束吗","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2068946744638103756"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-22T06:11:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2068939801047581149"],"id":"2068939801047581149","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1649,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":0},"text":"没完没了不分昼夜地做了两天期末作品终于结束了，只看结果其实还不错，至少我很喜欢，发出来给大家看也得到了很好的反馈，但心好累我真的好崩溃，我的端午假期除了在外地工作和设计期末作品之外忙的睡觉的时间都没有，其实也睡不太着，点开朋友圈看到大家都去旅游更是嘎巴一下碎在原地","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2068939801047581149"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-22T04:21:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2068912183602475023"],"id":"2068912183602475023","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":2267,"like_count":26,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":3},"text":"有钱的我就是世界上最邪恶最可恶最反派最无耻的生物，没钱的我就是这个世界上最纯真最无邪最善良最可爱的存在","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2068912183602475023"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-22T04:19:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2068911652993642573"],"id":"2068911652993642573","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":3282,"like_count":68,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":7},"text":"我每天：钱太少了，睡眠太少了，感到活着的瞬间太少了","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2068911652993642573"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-22T04:16:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2068910890347589800"],"id":"2068910890347589800","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":7044,"like_count":30,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":14,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我要怎么靠这41块去医院看病还要买车票以及吃三天饭 https://t.co/EUeYQQqM2P","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2068910890347589800"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","created_at":"2026-06-22T04:05:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2068908160786849803"],"id":"2068908160786849803","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":13